{"id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-rational.md","title":"Rational Numbers","display":"df-rational — Rational Numbers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-rational","aliases":["58-df-rational"],"display":"df-rational — Rational Numbers","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","[[58-df-ordered-pair]]","[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-rational"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-rational</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rational — Rational Numbers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bea77fab814b3292\" href=\"?note=bea77fab814b3292\" title=\"58-df-ordered-pair\">58-df-ordered-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}\\)</span> (integer set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-integer.md\">../batch20/58-df-integer.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\mathbb Z\\times(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0\\})\">\\(D=\\mathbb Z\\times(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0\\})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}\">\\(\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}\\)</span> (equivalence relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}\">\\(\\mathbb{Q}\\)</span> (rational number set defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\forall\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}\\langle c,d\\rangle\\leftrightarrow ad=bc\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\forall\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}\\langle c,d\\rangle\\leftrightarrow ad=bc\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational} \\vdash \\mathbb Q=D/{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}=\\{[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in D\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational} \\vdash \\mathbb Q=D/{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}=\\{[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in D\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> is constructed without presupposing fraction objects: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a/b\">\\(a/b\\)</span> denotes the class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\">\\([\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The rationals form an ordered field: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb{Q}, +, \\times, &lt;)\">\\((\\mathbb{Q}, +, \\times, &lt;)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}\">\\(\\mathbb{Q}\\)</span> is dense but not complete; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> is the completion</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordered-pair","status":"resolved","id":"bea77fab814b3292","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordered-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-integer.md","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb{Z}$ (integer set, see [[../batch20/58-df-integer.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\mathbb Z\\times(\\mathbb Z\\setminus\\{0\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\forall\\langle a,b\\rangle,\\langle c,d\\rangle\\in D\\;\\bigl(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}\\langle c,d\\rangle\\leftrightarrow ad=bc\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational} \\vdash \\mathbb Q=D/{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}=\\{[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}:\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in D\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"a/b","display":false},{"tex":"[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb{Q}, +, \\times, <)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false}],"bytes":1211,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a32009d673e1bd4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ 及其规范序、减法和绝对值使用 [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]；$\\mathbb Q^\\omega$ 是有理数值函数列的集合。"},{"id":"9e1e1a22b5758041","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ (standard rational-number field; see [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]])"},{"id":"b6b0fdef2692e665","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ 及 $[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}$ 使用 [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]；令 $Q(a,b)=[\\langle a,b\\rangle]_{\\sim_{\\mathbb Q}}$。"},{"id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ 为有理数集（see [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]），其序为 $<$"},{"id":"3b5b3d48ff1ff369","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4fcdcfdb0b1f6b92","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$ 为有理数集（see [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]）"},{"id":"b8eaf43a040e88b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f7968db43124080e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37d8cf418a7b6598","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q$（有理数有序域，见 [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]）"},{"id":"aa16587cad992289","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$+_{\\mathbb Q}:\\mathbb Q^2\\to\\mathbb Q$（有理数加法；see [[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1041","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md|58-df-rational]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["65d9a1e690c32aad","bea77fab814b32